OL,3,AEU offers UK fresh deal on 'Made in    
OL,4,AEurope' scheme                         
OL,6,FThe UK could be included in the EU's   
OL,7,Fproposed scheme to protect car         
OL,8,Fmanufacturing in Europe without Britain
OL,9,Fhaving to impose import taxes on       
OL,10,FChinese electric cars, under draft     
OL,11,Fplans.                                 
OL,13,FThe proposal has been drawn up by      
OL,14,FIreland, which currently holds the EU's
OL,15,Frotating presidency, and will be       
OL,16,Fdiscussed by European ambassadors later
OL,17,Fon Wednesday.                          
OL,19,FIt comes after previous suggestions the
OL,20,FEU would demand the UK align its       
OL,21,Ftariffs on Chinese electric vehicles as
OL,22,Fa condition of joining the scheme.     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
